Description: JHU and ICBM white matter atlases for the 'ggseg' ecosystem.
    Includes JHU probabilistic tracts (Hua et al. 2008), ICBM-DTI-81 white
    matter labels (Mori et al. 2005), and ICBM tract meshes. Provides unified
    'ggseg_atlas' objects with 3D mesh geometry, for use with 'ggseg3d'.
